\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4.6}{\ignorespaces Optimiser convergence on German Credit full-data regime. Left: convergence of mixture predictive log-likelihood across iterations. Right: final weight vectors for each algorithm. PGD and EM converge to near-identical solutions ($\|\Delta w\|_2 < 0.01$) while Frank-Wolfe degenerates to a sparse solution assigning weight $\approx 1.0$ to Student-T.}}{72}{figure.4.6}\protected@file@percent }
